# Local developer tooling and editor configuration.
#
# Everything under .claude/ is ignored by default -- it is each developer's
# own local assistant configuration. The skill and slash-command templates
# ssgrep *ships* live in src/ssgrep/templates/claude/ and are installed into
# the user's config dir by `ssgrep init`; the file-size hook wrapper lives in
# scripts/.
.claude/
.opencode/
openspec/
.pi/
CLAUDE.md

# Project-scoped MCP config: hardcodes an absolute path into this checkout's
# .venv (ssgrep isn't on PyPI, so there's no portable `uvx ssgrep` form).
# Not portable across machines or clone locations -- each dev should
# generate their own via `uv sync` + the MCP registration flow.
.mcp.json

# Autoresearch working files that must not be committed
.auto/corpus_snapshot/
.auto/last_run.json
.auto/tmp/
